WEBVTT

05:19.278 --> 05:23.824
Franken's gears

21:09.019 --> 21:10.354
- Hey.
- Nice to see you.

21:13.565 --> 21:15.609
- Nice to see you.
- Hello.

21:18.570 --> 21:21.240
Good day. Such lovely
weather we're having.

21:22.908 --> 21:23.909
Pardon me.

21:26.286 --> 21:27.286
Nice to see you!

21:56.275 --> 21:59.319
Look at that!
Look how high it went!

22:00.529 --> 22:03.240
Cool, huh? I did it, huh?

22:04.199 --> 22:05.409
Talk about height!

22:44.531 --> 22:46.116
Delicious soup.

22:49.328 --> 22:51.079
This warmth is a sin.

23:04.718 --> 23:07.638
I'm going out, papa.
Do your best at work, okay?

23:16.104 --> 23:19.191
My wife is a hard-working
career woman.

23:19.942 --> 23:24.488
I feel envy akin to jealousy
towards her at times.

23:32.913 --> 23:36.416
Because she's dynamic,
assertive, and dependable.

23:37.501 --> 23:39.837
She works hard enough
to put any man to shame.

23:45.342 --> 23:47.718
- Hey! This way!
- Hey, stop it already!

23:47.719 --> 23:50.138
How long are you going
to keep at this?!

23:52.099 --> 23:55.060
My colleagues say I'm a feminist.

23:55.811 --> 23:58.897
I acknowledge that myself,
but it's not quite the reason.

24:48.238 --> 24:49.865
Don't startle me like that.

24:50.407 --> 24:54.870
Break time over. The time has arrived.
Return to your place of business.

24:55.579 --> 24:57.581
Yes, yes. Work, work.

25:06.548 --> 25:08.008
I have a secret.

25:57.683 --> 26:00.102
I've never told my family, of course.

26:39.683 --> 26:41.977
I've never known a mother's love.

26:42.728 --> 26:44.438
I'm sure that's why...

26:44.897 --> 26:49.109
My desire to marry
far exceeded most people's.

26:49.776 --> 26:52.029
I sought femininity in my wife.

27:24.478 --> 27:25.478
What's wrong?

27:25.729 --> 27:27.439
Oh, go on without me.

27:32.694 --> 27:33.904
Hurry, please!

27:34.154 --> 27:35.322
I'm coming!

28:23.495 --> 28:25.622
Don't I have a name?

28:26.456 --> 28:28.667
Meow.

28:45.517 --> 28:49.271
I believe I would
like to fall in love.

28:50.898 --> 28:52.316
What are you talking about?

28:52.608 --> 28:55.986
I don't recall programming
those words into you.

29:00.240 --> 29:01.533
But you're lonely, yes?

29:04.494 --> 29:06.288
What are you talking about?

29:06.914 --> 29:08.707
I think I heard it
in your voice.

29:09.666 --> 29:12.085
You're still a little boy, aren't you?

29:14.880 --> 29:17.799
I'm surprised. You're becoming
aware of such things?

29:36.485 --> 29:37.903
Don't cry out like that.

29:53.043 --> 29:54.545
Don't come at me like that.

29:55.712 --> 29:57.339
What do I exist for?

29:59.424 --> 30:00.801
I want to be closer to you.

30:03.011 --> 30:04.721
Does a machine feel pain?

30:08.308 --> 30:10.601
There's no such thing as
a robot gourmet, right?

30:10.602 --> 30:12.479
Can a robot even
have a personality?

30:17.276 --> 30:20.445
But I know myself very well.

30:29.663 --> 30:32.249
I want to have all kinds
of exciting experiences.

30:32.708 --> 30:33.834
All of my own will.

30:37.754 --> 30:40.591
Oh my. Such a cynical smile.

33:09.239 --> 33:11.158
Heading out, are you?

33:11.742 --> 33:13.118
Yes, dad.

33:13.744 --> 33:15.579
Next time, all three
of us will come.

33:16.121 --> 33:17.706
Be good to mom, okay?

33:18.749 --> 33:21.251
Now, say goodbye to grandpa.

33:24.755 --> 33:26.381
See you later, grandpa.

33:27.132 --> 33:28.926
Make me a toy next time, okay?

33:29.218 --> 33:32.471
Okay. Take care on
your way home.

33:39.311 --> 33:40.604
Bye-bye!

35:25.834 --> 35:29.296
I've been waiting for my prince.

36:19.513 --> 36:21.890
Couldn't be...

36:22.516 --> 36:24.017
Your "daddy-long-legs."

38:27.432 --> 38:28.475
Dear?

38:30.519 --> 38:33.897
Dear? The wind's starting up.

39:29.453 --> 39:33.832
Dear, you're not a child, now.
Do as you're told.

39:36.919 --> 39:37.919
Dear?

01:01:02.579 --> 01:01:10.579
Mao lamdo

01:01:27.396 --> 01:01:32.526
Early meiji period

01:03:07.538 --> 01:03:10.541
"The travels of Marco Polo"

01:03:10.832 --> 01:03:14.920
you bastard! Right!
Time to teach you a lesson!

01:03:15.045 --> 01:03:19.049
- Yayoi, is it ready?
- Yes, but is it okay to use it without permission?

01:03:19.216 --> 01:03:21.425
Won't everyone in the
tenements be angry?

01:03:21.426 --> 01:03:23.554
Shut up, dumb-ass!
Japan's in danger!

01:03:23.971 --> 01:03:27.432
- Daimaru! Get shoveling that coal!
- Right!

01:03:27.641 --> 01:03:29.309
Denjiro! Look lively!

01:03:29.518 --> 01:03:30.518
Okay.

01:03:30.811 --> 01:03:32.187
Start it up!

01:03:32.729 --> 01:03:34.565
Go, go, go!

01:03:55.711 --> 01:04:00.215
Hey, hey, hey! You big stupid thing!
Hold it right there!

01:04:00.716 --> 01:04:04.719
Attention, villain who disrupts the
peace of our post-restoration world!

01:04:04.720 --> 01:04:09.391
We of the tenements created this mechanical
palanquin for the harbor festival.

01:04:09.474 --> 01:04:13.102
We weren't expecting this to be
steamer benkei's first time in action,

01:04:13.103 --> 01:04:16.147
but I, komagata sankichi won't
move a step from where I am!

01:04:16.148 --> 01:04:18.734
Now I'm coming to bust you up,
so you better stay put!

01:04:19.818 --> 01:04:22.404
Let's go! Forward!

01:04:24.406 --> 01:04:27.159
- Denjiro! Raise right foot!
- Yes, yes.

01:04:34.708 --> 01:04:37.211
You idiot! Move it more gently!

01:05:04.404 --> 01:05:07.406
Sankichi! Someone's come out!

01:05:07.407 --> 01:05:09.826
What? Hey, denjiro! Stop it!

01:05:11.995 --> 01:05:13.247
Let's see...

01:05:13.664 --> 01:05:15.707
That's... oh!

01:05:15.874 --> 01:05:17.084
It's a foreigner...

01:05:18.126 --> 01:05:20.753
A-A-A foreigner! Hey!
Fukusuke! It's a foreigner!

01:05:20.754 --> 01:05:23.340
- Hey, what do I do?
- Sankichi, please, calm down!

01:06:01.211 --> 01:06:02.712
Hey, what'd he say?

01:06:02.713 --> 01:06:05.882
I don't know. If it was English,
I could handle it,

01:06:05.883 --> 01:06:08.051
but I haven't studied
much American...

01:06:17.311 --> 01:06:19.979
Daimaru! He's sending
Cannon fire our way!

01:06:19.980 --> 01:06:22.357
- Get up here!
- Okay!

01:06:39.917 --> 01:06:42.126
That asshole!
He got us good, huh?

01:06:42.127 --> 01:06:44.128
Sankichi, what are you doing?

01:06:44.129 --> 01:06:46.798
- Shut up and hold on!
- What was that?

01:06:48.759 --> 01:06:52.095
Sankichi! I'm here!

01:06:53.347 --> 01:06:55.765
Isn't this the canister
for the fireworks?

01:06:55.766 --> 01:06:57.809
Yeah, but I made a
few modifications.

01:07:01.772 --> 01:07:03.315
Watch this!

01:07:03.649 --> 01:07:05.234
- Let's go!
- Ready!

01:07:12.241 --> 01:07:14.243
Yeah! Fireworks!

01:07:15.953 --> 01:07:18.329
What's it got beneath the wood?

01:07:18.330 --> 01:07:19.665
Bricks!

01:07:26.713 --> 01:07:28.340
It's all so noisy.

01:07:28.924 --> 01:07:30.759
What do we do, sankichi?

01:07:30.843 --> 01:07:33.636
Listen up, daimaru! We fire
at the guy on the shoulder!

01:07:33.637 --> 01:07:36.180
Huh? But if it hits him,
he'll die!

01:07:36.181 --> 01:07:38.599
- Just fire!
- Fine!

01:07:38.600 --> 01:07:39.600
Ready?

01:07:41.103 --> 01:07:42.103
Fire!

01:08:12.009 --> 01:08:13.426
We did it!

01:08:13.427 --> 01:08:16.679
- That was your goal from the start, huh?
- What're you talking about?

01:08:16.680 --> 01:08:19.266
Okay! Now for benkei to
beat the crap out of it!

01:08:25.731 --> 01:08:27.733
Hey, get a hold of yourself!

01:08:28.775 --> 01:08:32.195
You're destroying the tenements
with all this Cannon fire!

01:08:32.196 --> 01:08:34.030
Shut up! This is no time for that!

01:08:34.031 --> 01:08:36.741
- What was that, you dimwit?
- Dimwit?!

01:08:36.742 --> 01:08:38.451
- Sankichi!
- Shut up!

01:08:38.452 --> 01:08:42.789
- You're a dimwit, a moron, a total bird-brain!
- What was that, you pig-faced woman?!

01:08:44.917 --> 01:08:47.877
It's been acting up since
that last Cannon hit...

01:08:47.878 --> 01:08:50.380
You're so annoying!
Shut the hell up!

01:08:50.506 --> 01:08:52.673
What? Pig-faced?!

01:08:52.674 --> 01:08:55.843
Better than someone who loses
their temper over nothing!

01:08:55.844 --> 01:08:57.845
You stupid little...!

01:08:57.846 --> 01:09:01.098
Don't act so big! You've
got no brains in your head.

01:09:01.099 --> 01:09:03.017
Why not learn how
to read and write?

01:09:03.018 --> 01:09:05.102
I know of monkeys
smarter than you!

01:09:05.103 --> 01:09:07.731
You are seriously
getting on my nerves.

01:09:07.940 --> 01:09:09.816
- Meh!
- You little...

01:09:10.150 --> 01:09:12.236
No choice, I guess.

01:09:12.402 --> 01:09:14.488
We've got to do something.

01:09:19.618 --> 01:09:20.869
Sankichi!

01:09:22.788 --> 01:09:25.332
- Idiot!
- I'm sorry!

01:09:36.552 --> 01:09:39.680
Hey sankichi! We're out of coal!

01:09:39.763 --> 01:09:43.058
Never mind that! Find some boards
we don't need and burn them!

01:09:46.770 --> 01:09:48.605
There we go!

01:10:04.538 --> 01:10:05.706
Here he is...

01:10:17.217 --> 01:10:19.636
Fukusuke! Right arm up!

01:10:25.225 --> 01:10:27.393
Good! Yayoi, left arm up!

01:10:27.394 --> 01:10:29.688
- Grab his arm!
- What are we doing?

01:10:30.856 --> 01:10:32.774
We're gonna pin him
and finish this!

01:10:36.862 --> 01:10:38.989
- Got him!
- Hold him tight!

01:10:39.239 --> 01:10:41.074
- Fukusuke! You good?
- I'm fine!

01:10:41.450 --> 01:10:43.452
Daimaru! We're about to start!

01:10:44.786 --> 01:10:47.122
- Denjiro! We're going!
- Give the word.

01:10:47.331 --> 01:10:50.334
Okay! Plant the left leg!
Turn left!

01:10:55.422 --> 01:10:58.509
Go!

01:11:00.219 --> 01:11:01.720
Er...

01:11:22.699 --> 01:11:25.786
Oh... the city...

01:11:27.621 --> 01:11:29.873
The tenements...

01:11:34.711 --> 01:11:37.463
- We won.
- That's up for debate.

01:11:37.464 --> 01:11:38.715
Yeah.

01:11:39.258 --> 01:11:41.760
- But you did very well.
- Look at that, everyone!

01:11:42.052 --> 01:11:44.053
The rising sun of Japan!

01:11:44.054 --> 01:11:46.849
- That's the setting sun.
- Oh. Oh?

01:11:51.144 --> 01:11:52.521
S-Sorry!

01:11:52.771 --> 01:11:55.440
Th-the point is,
the battle's over.

01:11:55.607 --> 01:11:58.109
We did punish that
enemy ourselves.

01:11:58.110 --> 01:12:01.697
Well, we protected the peace, so...

01:12:02.489 --> 01:12:03.782
You know...

01:12:07.744 --> 01:12:09.371
Oh no!

01:12:44.907 --> 01:12:50.120
The end

01:12:53.332 --> 01:12:58.003
chicken man and red neck

